\section{Risk Analysis}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{4.5cm}p{1.8cm}p{6cm}@{}}
\toprule
Risk & Level & Mitigation \\
\midrule
Bangla text renders incorrectly in GUI & High & Install Noto Bengali font; fall back to PyQt/web UI \\
Poor answer accuracy & Medium & Expand keywords; test with real sentences \\
Raspberry Pi hardware failure & Low & Regular Git backups, spare SD card \\
Schedule slip & Medium & Voice module is optional and cut first \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}

\section{Budget}\label{sec:budget}
Raspberry Pi 4, microSD, power supply, case, and display. Fill in local prices.
Software is free and open source.

\section{Testing Plan}
Unit tests for \texttt{BanglaNLP} and \texttt{KnowledgeBase}; integration tests for
the chat flow; user testing with at least 10 students; accuracy target: at least 80\%
correct answers on 50 test questions.

